  "releaseNotes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at b4c7683582d65b4b513e6fa254e9f60367445750 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* docs: fix OpenSpec main specs to pass openspec validate --strict by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/80\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Extract shared validation service by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/79\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add runtime contract catalog by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/81\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Introduce handler registry by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/82\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Centralize ignore and baseline context by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/84\n* Tooling: Add analysis session indexes by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/105\n* Tooling: Split diagnostics model behind formatters by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/122\n* Tooling: Add self-policy for internal validation-pipeline boundaries by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/124\n* Tooling: Add solution and project discovery by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/125\n* Tooling: Add architecture policy consistency checks (#66) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/126\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0",
